@page "/"

@* Official Part 1 Task 2 startup menu. Only telemetry is in scope; the other pillars stay visible and locked. *@

<PageTitle>Smart-X Gateway — Startup</PageTitle>

<section class="startup">
    <header class="startup-header">
        <p class="startup-kicker">Smart-X simulated IoT gateway</p>
        <h1>Select an operational pillar</h1>
        <p class="startup-lead">
            Hydroponics, utilities, and site-meter telemetry. Progressive Disclosure dashboard
            is attached to ingestion only.
        </p>
    </header>

    <div class="pillar-grid">
        <a class="pillar pillar-enabled" href="telemetry">
            <span class="pillar-status">Available</span>
            <h2>Sensor Data Ingestion and Telemetry</h2>
            <p>Register ESP32 devices, ingest heterogeneous packets, and investigate health and freshness.</p>
            <span class="pillar-action">Open telemetry dashboard</span>
        </a>

        <div class="pillar pillar-locked" aria-disabled="true">
            <span class="pillar-status">Locked</span>
            <h2>Real-Time Command Stream and History</h2>
            <p>Downstream commands to actuators. Visible for the three-pillar layout; enabled in official Part 2.</p>
            <span class="pillar-action">Unavailable in this assessment part</span>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar pillar-locked" aria-disabled="true">
            <span class="pillar-status">Locked</span>
            <h2>Network Topology and Mesh Routing</h2>
            <p>Site mesh and routing. Visible for the three-pillar layout; enabled in the final PoE.</p>
            <span class="pillar-action">Unavailable until final PoE</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p class="startup-ops">
        <a href="telemetry/register">Register ESP32</a>
        ·
        <a href="telemetry/ingest">Ingest a packet</a>
    </p>
</section>
